WEBVTT

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.440
The front page is a summary

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.760
of all the five sales channels.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:20.550
My question on this is: how do we know…

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:23.730
…if an inquiry is relevant or genuine or not?

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:26.480
Is there a way to update the table?

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:27.980
Or provide feedback?

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.910
It’s definitely the key customers…

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:33.910
…inbound inquiries…

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:37.330
…and the target list.

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:39.770
I think they’ll be super useful tools.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:41.290
Coming together very nicely.
